      "id": "spin-selling-s015-p00182",
      "source_en": "Obtaining Commitment: Four Successful Actions But however well you set your call objectives, you've still got to gain the customer's commitment and acceptance. Huthwaite's studies of success in the major sale show that effective salespeople use rather simple and straightforward ways of obtaining commitment. We found that there are four clear actions that successful people tend to use to help them obtain commitment from their customers:",
